00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.020
Keep on rocking, brother.

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:50.020
Yeah.

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:56.640
So listen, I am not trying to DM or WhatsApp
anybody in the audience.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:02.050
There are rampant scammers on our YouTube
channel and they will put my face.

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:07.140
Imagine that this face, they put my face as
their profile image and they respond to people

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:10.230
in the comment and they say, Hey, I'd love
to chat with you directly.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.040
Please WhatsApp me DM me here, this, that,
the other thing.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:14.040
And it's a scam.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.420
They want to steal your money.

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:19.460
Okay, we report them to YouTube as fast as
we can.

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:24.680
You can report them to YouTube, say that they
are impersonating me and YouTube will ban

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.250
them, but it's like whack a mole.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:30.120
Okay, so I'm not trying to contact anyone.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:33.810
The only time I'm in touch with viewers is
when they call in.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:34.810
When we take calls.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:35.810
All right.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:36.850
So not me.

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:37.850
Don't fall for it.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:41.510
Jeffrey asks, Should we leave the country?

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.150
This is sad situation.

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:49.390
Jeffrey says, I've been concerned for a while
now that if an autocrat is elected in 24,

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:54.210
it may be time to really consider leaving
the U.S. and moving to a country that has

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:56.010
a stable democracy.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.730
Through my work, I could get a visa in a Scandinavian
country, Andorra.

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:01.800
My wife has dual citizenship in Australia.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:07.150
I think it's important for my children to
live in a safe, free country and I'm concerned

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:10.280
we could be seeing the end of such a country
here in the US.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:14.190
Leaving the country has always seemed like
a drastic step to me, but it seems it's becoming

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.600
more of a reality.

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:16.600
What do you think?

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:20.260
Well, you know, every time this comes up,
people get mad at me and they say, David,

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:23.420
you're dripping with privilege when you talk
about this.

00:10:23.420 --> 00:10:31.531
It is a reality that I was born in Argentina,
so if I needed to go to another country, I

00:10:31.531 --> 00:10:33.560
could go back to Argentina.

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:37.020
And by the way, if you look at the economic
situation and who's in power right now down

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:41.040
there, it's it's no it's no dream to be down
there.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:42.040
Okay.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.080
But it's something.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.430
All right.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:49.510
As an individual of the Jewish persuasion,
as who was it that said?

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:50.510
I don't remember.

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:51.720
Anyway, I'm Jewish.

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:53.200
I could go through a process.

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:57.780
I believe it takes a year or two to get citizenship
