00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:04.870
And yes, because my family is originally from
Western Europe and fled right before the Holocaust,

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:11.390
Poland has a program where I could request
citizenship because my grandfather was from

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:12.860
Poland.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:13.860
I'm working on it.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.160
I still don't have the documents.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.650
I need to do that.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:17.830
So, yeah, I'm.

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.480
I'm working on a backup plan for sure.

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:24.040
Now, am I in this like I'm moving to Canada?

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.450
DeSantis wins in 24.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.460
Now, first of all, it's really hard to move
to Canada.

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:31.680
I don't know how many of you have looked into
it, but no, I'm not saying that.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:35.310
But what I would say, Geoffrey, is.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:39.680
You are going to do what is best for your
family.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.520
And so I would have the plan in place.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:45.500
Why not give yourself options?

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:50.080
And then if the time should come, you can
avail yourself of those options.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:52.110
What else can I say?

